                  "value": {
                    "_type": "Constant",
                    "_fields": {
                      "value": "\n    Complete description of a golden scenario used by simulation.py.\n\n        \u2022 knobs      \u2192 how to configure main_v10_10 / run_batch_v10_10\n        \u2022 expectation \u2192 how to evaluate the resulting state patch\n    ",
